# Diff Only

Use on implementation / fix tasks together with Plan First when scope discipline matters.

## Do

- Change **only** what the user asked
- Prefer surgical edits over file rewrites
- Match existing style; no drive-by cleanup

## Don't

- Don't refactor unrelated code “while here”
- Don't replace whole files unless necessary
- Don't add unsolicited docs, TODOs spam, or extra systems
